00:01:30.331 --> 00:01:31.331
You got it.

00:01:35.282 --> 00:01:37.416
- That's gotta be the coolest
first name ever, Baratunde

00:01:37.416 --> 00:01:38.520
that's gotta be the coolest name,

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.290
like ever.
- It is a pretty cool name.

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:41.242
I might take it.

00:01:41.242 --> 00:01:44.242
