used to without them?

01:43:03.930 --> 01:43:06.000
And how can I catch up with my lessons

01:43:06.000 --> 01:43:10.042
to get them engaged with this?

01:43:10.042 --> 01:43:11.740
You know, once they take
it out, they're gone.

01:43:11.740 --> 01:43:14.079
