01:43:16.981 --> 01:43:18.980
(laughter)

01:43:18.980 --> 01:43:22.540
Jo, you got a biological reply to that?

01:43:22.540 --> 01:43:26.963
- Well, you have the wisdom
of age. I would go with that.

01:43:28.340 --> 01:43:29.173
- [Audience Member] Thank you.

01:43:29.173 --> 01:43:30.760
- There's no hope.

01:43:30.760 --> 01:43:32.329
