01:47:00.108 --> 01:47:01.480
(laughter)

01:47:01.480 --> 01:47:05.170
So, are you asking, what
pathway might you take?

01:47:05.170 --> 01:47:08.404
To be in service as my two esteemed

01:47:08.404 --> 01:47:10.180
colleagues here have been?

01:47:10.180 --> 01:47:12.130
- Yeah because, you know, you're applying

01:47:12.130 --> 01:47:16.960
for endless internships, there's
giant pools of applicants,

01:47:16.960 --> 01:47:18.256
just what do you guys think that--

01:47:18.256 --> 01:47:20.450
- How do you get in? How do you get in?

01:47:20.450 --> 01:47:22.740
- Well, it's interesting.

01:47:22.740 --> 01:47:25.040
First of all, depending on
your level, you can apply

01:47:25.040 --> 01:47:28.080
for some of the very
interesting fellowships

01:47:28.080 --> 01:47:30.870
in science and public policy
The Triple A has fellowships,

01:47:30.870 --> 01:47:33.277
the American Chemical Society fellowships,

01:47:33.277 --> 01:47:35.160
but the other thing you
can do is you can just

01:47:35.160 --> 01:47:37.450
present yourself at an office.

01:47:37.450 --> 01:47:41.030
We hired some folks at OSTP
who just walked in the door

01:47:41.030 --> 01:47:44.110
and said we'd like to help.
Some of them walked in the door

01:47:44.110 --> 01:47:45.800
and said we're so interested in helping,

01:47:45.800 --> 01:47:48.706
we'll help for nothing. We
took those first, of course.

01:47:48.706 --> 01:47:49.880
(laughter)

01:47:49.880 --> 01:47:52.300
And some of them did such wonderful work

01:47:52.300 --> 01:47:53.513
we decided to pay them.

01:47:55.050 --> 01:47:58.730
So you basically need to step up.

01:47:58.730 --> 01:48:02.270
And have confidence that
if you present yourself

01:48:02.270 --> 01:48:05.350
and talk about what you wanna
do and what you could do,

01:48:05.350 --> 01:48:08.530
you may well get a post,
you may well get a position.

01:48:08.530 --> 01:48:10.690
- One policy request that
you could really help me with

01:48:10.690 --> 01:48:12.520
'cuz it's something I'm
fighting for, but if you're a

01:48:12.520 --> 01:48:16.354
