01:48:16.354 --> 01:48:19.270
in New Jersey really face
this threat, and you wanna

01:48:19.270 --> 01:48:21.890
go into public service
and do things like this,

01:48:21.890 --> 01:48:25.080
you should not have college debt.

01:48:25.080 --> 01:48:26.920
And it's something we
need to do as a country

01:48:26.920 --> 01:48:28.150
