nations who are dramatically

01:48:33.660 --> 01:48:36.930
lowering the cost of
colleges and universities.

01:48:36.930 --> 01:48:39.250
So thank you for your desire to serve,

01:48:39.250 --> 01:48:41.340
and this nation should be liberating you

01:48:41.340 --> 01:48:43.290
from the tens of thousands
of dollars of debt

01:48:43.290 --> 01:48:46.370
that our average college graduates carry.

01:48:46.370 --> 01:48:48.330
- And I wanna pick up
on a point John made.

01:48:48.330 --> 01:48:51.360
There aren't for so many jobs that you see

01:48:51.360 --> 01:48:56.360
that have high luminosity,
there is no actual path

01:48:57.320 --> 01:49:00.230
that guarantees you will
land in those spots.

01:49:00.230 --> 01:49:03.760
Often, it is the tenacity of the person

01:49:03.760 --> 01:49:06.660
who ultimately occupies that
spot that got them there.

01:49:06.660 --> 01:49:10.037
So, you can't be an actor
and say, "I wanna be

01:49:10.037 --> 01:49:11.867
"a famous actor just like this person,

01:49:11.867 --> 01:49:14.680
"what do I need to do? I'll
do exactly what they did."

01:49:14.680 --> 01:49:16.950
'Cuz what they did might
have been a unique path

01:49:16.950 --> 01:49:19.241
to that point. You
gotta find what might be

01:49:19.241 --> 01:49:21.230
the unique path for you.

01:49:21.230 --> 01:49:23.980
And, is it interning
at an aerospace company

01:49:23.980 --> 01:49:26.880
that actually has people in Washington

01:49:26.880 --> 01:49:29.333
who are talking to members of Congress?

01:49:29.333 --> 01:49:33.320
So it's not a pre-scripted,

01:49:33.320 --> 01:49:36.413
it's not a pre-scripted route.

01:49:37.270 --> 01:49:39.430
And it takes the tenacity at each point,

01:49:39.430 --> 01:49:41.340
at each pivot point of your career,

01:49:41.340 --> 01:49:43.790
to ask yourself, what do I need to do?

01:49:43.790 --> 01:49:46.050
Whether or not someone
has done that before you.

01:49:46.050 --> 01:49:48.500
- Well, a great example
is John, who stalked

01:49:48.500 --> 01:49:50.490
everybody who had his job before him.

01:49:50.490 --> 01:49:51.650
(laughter)

01:49:51.650 --> 01:49:54.980
So stalking, like
systematically, your predesecors.

01:49:54.980 --> 01:49:57.171
- You get the list of people to stalk.

01:49:57.171 --> 01:49:58.350
(indistinct chatter)

