01:50:08.147 --> 01:50:09.494
(laughter)

01:50:09.494 --> 01:50:10.862
- Selfie from a distance.

01:50:10.862 --> 01:50:14.143
- Afterwards? I'm wearing a
shirt with your face on it.

01:50:15.786 --> 01:50:17.910
- Almost every shirt that exists out there

01:50:17.910 --> 01:50:21.497
with my face on it, is
like bootlegged, so.

01:50:21.497 --> 01:50:22.803
Reign that in.

01:50:25.410 --> 01:50:27.770
So if you come down, I'll be here

01:50:27.770 --> 01:50:29.263
and you can take a picture, okay?

01:50:29.263 --> 01:50:30.520
All right, we only have
time for like a couple

01:50:30.520 --> 01:50:32.030
more questions before we call it quits.

01:50:32.030 --> 01:50:32.899
Let's go, right here, yeah.

01:50:32.899 --> 01:50:34.276
- Speed round.

01:50:34.276 --> 01:50:35.417
- [Audience Member]
You know, we're talking

01:50:35.417 --> 01:50:36.250
about making America smart again,

01:50:36.250 --> 01:50:37.940
but every time I go online,
I see a lot of stupidity

01:50:37.940 --> 01:50:39.670
that's rampant, and a
lot of it's irrational.

01:50:39.670 --> 01:50:43.030
You know, conspiracy
theories, Earth is flat,

01:50:43.030 --> 01:50:47.020
we didn't go to the moon,
9/11 truthers, GMO stuff.

01:50:47.020 --> 01:50:49.760
How can we as a society combat

01:50:49.760 --> 01:50:52.106
that really irrational stupidity?

01:50:52.106 --> 01:50:54.356
(applause)

01:50:55.320 --> 01:50:57.130
- Let me offer a reflection,
but then I'll defer

01:50:57.130 --> 01:50:59.160
to my panelists here.

01:50:59.160 --> 01:51:03.380
So, the Internet, is the
greatest access to knowledge

01:51:03.380 --> 01:51:07.600
there ever was. But you
also have this delusion

01:51:07.600 --> 01:51:11.040
that no matter your thought,
if you type in a search for it,

01:51:11.040 --> 01:51:13.190
you will find everyone else in the world

01:51:13.190 --> 01:51:16.690
who has as crazy a thought
as you just typed in,

01:51:16.690 --> 01:51:19.890
validating what you think is real.

01:51:19.890 --> 01:51:22.990
Because of how many other
people share the view.

01:51:22.990 --> 01:51:27.410
And so, the search engines,
maybe they should say,

01:51:27.410 --> 01:51:28.576
do you realize?

01:51:28.576 --> 01:51:30.826
(laughter)

01:51:32.200 --> 01:51:33.969
Do you really wanna search this?

01:51:33.969 --> 01:51:36.482
(laughter)

01:51:36.482 --> 01:51:38.790
Will you take this breathalyzer
before we send you?

01:51:38.790 --> 01:51:42.250
I mean, you know what's missing?

01:51:42.250 --> 01:51:47.250
Internet savvy 101 in school.

01:51:47.460 --> 01:51:50.310
All right, somewhere in
school, you gotta be taught

01:51:50.310 --> 01:51:52.930
that some information is more likely

01:51:52.930 --> 01:51:57.133
to be true than others,
depending on its source, okay?

01:51:58.050 --> 01:52:00.067
At some point we need to learn that.

01:52:00.067 --> 01:52:02.370
And it's not in the K
through 12 curriculum,

01:52:02.370 --> 01:52:03.520
last I checked.

01:52:03.520 --> 01:52:06.063
So that's a problem.
And the flat Earthers,

01:52:08.097 --> 01:52:10.600
this is a free country.
You can say what you want,

01:52:10.600 --> 01:52:14.460
fake what you want. You wanna
think the Earth is flat,

01:52:14.460 --> 01:52:19.460
go right ahead. But try
not to become head of NASA

01:52:19.690 --> 01:52:21.263
if you think that way, okay?

01:52:22.470 --> 01:52:25.510
Plenty of jobs for you if you wanna think

01:52:25.510 --> 01:52:28.937
the Earth is flat. Plenty
of jobs you can have.

01:52:28.937 --> 01:52:32.250
So, yeah. If this keeps
up, Cory I don't know

01:52:32.250 --> 01:52:33.820
what the future of the country is

01:52:33.820 --> 01:52:38.150
if this kinds of anti-scientific
thinking spreads,

01:52:38.150 --> 01:52:40.150
becomes sort of infectious,

01:52:40.150 --> 01:52:42.643
that we just go over the waterfall.

01:52:43.580 --> 01:52:45.050
- We gotta be the antibiotics then.

01:52:45.050 --> 01:52:47.930
Match the lies with truth.
Fight it just as hard.

01:52:47.930 --> 01:52:52.720
It's just like technologies
of old. Television, radio,

01:52:52.720 --> 01:52:54.720
it's a neutral platform
where a lot of people

01:52:54.720 --> 01:52:57.180
are getting on, it's a contest of ideas,

01:52:57.180 --> 01:52:59.590
and we've gotta match
those lies with truth.

01:52:59.590 --> 01:53:01.103
And be purveyors of it.

01:53:03.124 --> 01:53:04.880
(applause)

01:53:04.880 --> 01:53:05.713
